  },
  {
   "action": "settings.local_voice_switch_offer",
   "kind": "by_design",
   "reason": "The switch to local voice is the owner's yes on its own card, once; Laya never takes it."
  },
  {
   "action": "settings.interruptions",
   "kind": "by_design",
   "reason": "The interruption limit, quiet-hour times and Focus Assist are the owner's to loosen; by voice Laya can only quiet things (quiet until morning)."
  }
 ],
 "notes": [
  {
   "id": "meeting_retention",
   "text": "Meeting retention (meeting_audio_retention, meeting_text_retention, meeting_text_retention_days) is the owner's own choice, set in Privacy & Data and the Meetings view; it is not a voice-settable key and has no verb."
  },
  {
   "id": "voice_live_trim",
   "text": "The Gemini Live options row 'Trim what each call carries' sets voice_live_trim (off, shadow, on). It is a settings-panel row, not one of the audited UI actions, so it has no verb here. Laya reaches it by voice through the call's own tools: 'use fewer tools' and 'give me everything' are in resources/voice_session_phrasings.json (more_tools, internal gate, ring 1). Changing the mode itself stays the owner's choice in the panel.",
   "verbs": ["voice_session.fewer_tools", "voice_session.everything"]
  }
